title: The <span style="color: #7A3C00;">far</span>-<span style="color: #3E88B3;">right</span> Ascendant?
subtitle: The beginning of the end.
view-if: chancellor == "Selden"
max-visits: 1
on-arrival: marcher_in_government = 0
tags: event
new-page: true

With Selden and Hargen in charge of the Commonwealth, presiding over a <span style="color: #7A3C00;">far</span>-<span style="color: #3E88B3;">right</span> "New Stowford" Coalition ruling by presidential decree, the beginning of the end is near. 

However, the two coalition parties have irreparable differences over the Commonwealth <span style="color: #808080;">monarchy</span> and next steps, and with the <span style="color: #3E88B3;">nationalists</span> having an edge over their dynamic peers, it seems that this arrangement won't last. Furthermore, it is anticipated that the current government will avoid any moves to restore the monarchy until after the 4300 referendum, and the cabinet must survive until then.

What are we to do now?

- @fight: We will fight on the streets to prevent Selden from consolidating power.
- @game_over: We will vote against the government in the Assembly.


@fight

Do we realize that this means civil war, against the full force of the state?

- @civil_war: Yes.
- @game_over: We are not ready for war. Instead, we will vote against the government in the Assembly.